\section{Norwegian legal forms}{

Common codes for the \code{legal_form} parameter:
\itemize{
\item \strong{AS}: Private limited company (like UK Ltd, German GmbH)
\item \strong{ASA}: Public limited company (like UK PLC, German AG)
\item \strong{ENK}: Sole proprietorship
\item \strong{NUF}: Norwegian-registered foreign entity (branch office)
}

See \link{legal_forms} for the complete list with English translations.
